# icons

The starter includes `icons/icon.svg` as a sample static icon. <% if (it.plugin) { %>Plugins do not have a palette icon, so use `resources/badge.svg` in the sidebar UI.<% } else { %>For nodes it is registered as the palette icon in `client/index.ts`; replace it with your own 32×32 SVG or PNG.<% } %> flowup build copies this directory into `dist/icons/` automatically.
